{"id":"grok_long_027","group_id":"grok_long_20261015_not_selfplan","text":"自分で剣に持ち替えるわ","context":[{"role":"assistant","text":"持ち替え、オレがやってもええで。"},{"role":"user","text":"操作権限の確認中"},{"role":"assistant","text":"自動切替もできるけど、任意や。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"今の右手は地図やな。"},{"role":"user","text":"手動ルートを試す"},{"role":"assistant","text":"了解。オレは触らん。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"成功したら教えてな。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"ログは手動切替で残せる。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"待ってるで。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"必要なら見ているだけにするわ。"}],"label":"not_request","needs_clarification":false,"tags":["statement","context"],"source":"synthetic","rationale":"ユーザー自身が持ち替える宣言。ドギドへの依頼ではない。"}
{"id":"grok_long_028","group_id":"grok_long_20261015_not_idle","text":"なんか落ち着くな","context":[{"role":"assistant","text":"風の音だけや。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"敵の気配は薄い。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"羊が遠くで鳴いてる。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"空は晴れやで。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"特に警告は出してない。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"計測の合間やな。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"次の指示、いつでもどうぞ。"},{"role":"assistant","text":"今は待機でええと思う。"}],"label":"not_request","needs_clarification":false,"tags":["statement","casual","context"],"source":"synthetic","rationale":"雰囲気の感想だけで、質問も操作もない。"}
